  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer planar multilayer thin film stack on CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat), ZnS, Al2O3 (Kischkat) (22 coating layers total). Initialize all 22 layer thicknesses with random perturbation of ±50 nm around the iteration_12 best candidate thicknesses [967.0, 625.0, 727.5, 670.5, 446.0, 1179.0, 372.5, 588.5, 873.0, 492.0, 472.0, 1135.0, 328.0, 448.0, 854.0, 441.5, 832.0, 1240.5, 932.5, 391.5, 818.5, 871.5] nm, then optimize using bounded quasi-Newton gradient descent with thickness bounds 50-1500 nm. Evaluate coherent transfer matrix method in frequency domain. Score four independent mean-transmittance targets: maximize in 3250-3350 nm, maximize in 4200-4300 nm, minimize in 2500-3100 nm, minimize in 4450-5000 nm. No metal layers. Materials resolved from registry: zns, Al2O3 (Kischkat), CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate.",
